  m_text: "A bonafide tried and true career mercenary. \nWell traveled and even better
    trained, \nequipped with the skills to play in the big leagues. \nYou\u2019ve
    tackled numerous jobs with varying \nsuccess rates but manage to come home \nbreathing
    at the end. \nYour last gig left you worse for ware \nand your previous crew
    has whispered about your failure. \nThe criminal underground shuns you, \nworried
    you\u2019ll jinx the job. \nNows your chance to reclaim your rep and score big."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fdc7906da3973c4aafa98f9cfe909cc, type: 2}
