  m_text: "Living paycheck to paycheck \nworking at a corner store in the inner city,
    \nthe most interesting parts of your day being the faces \nyou committed to memory,
    \nand the new faces you have yet to memorize. \nLife is hard, \nand you rarely
    get breaks from its crushing weight, \nthat is, until rumours of a potentially
    high profit job \nstart to circulate in your area, \noffering the kind of money
    \nthat could have you set for a while. \nAfter some thought, you decide nows
    the big break \nyou've been waiting for, \nand step headfirst into your new career. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fdc7906da3973c4aafa98f9cfe909cc, type: 2}
