  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You're not like the others who look for this type of work, \nlooking for
    their next big break, \nor to get a hold of as much money as possible. \nInstead,this
    gig is much more personal. \nRecently, your company has just lost its contract
    with \nFangs & Finance as their onsite security detail, \nfurthermore you lost
    it to your biggest competitor \nPawz Bank. \nNow, your way of life is being threatened,
    \nas the loss of income has made apparent \nthe upcoming \u201Cbudget cuts\u201D
    your \nparent corporation has planned. \nRunning low on ideas, \nyou decide it's
    time to take matters into your own hands, \nand prove to Fangs & Finance why
    your security is the best there is."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fdc7906da3973c4aafa98f9cfe909cc, type: 2}
